      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So VRChat has a hard and a soft cap for worlds, the soft cap is the one you can put in, the hard cap will always be the double of it. \nIf a world has reached it's soft cap, people can only join via invites or the friend list, they can't join through the normal world list anymore. When the hard cap (double of soft cap) is reached no one can join, not even through invites or the friends list. \nSo that is as intended, but that setting the soft cap to 1 and the game not doubling the hard cap (which should be 2) is technically a bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6129166803de4e41e3b10109",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68",
        "alias": "Evolutionary Vicuna",
        "aliasID": "65ba088fed6eefce4ca8dc62",
