      "postID": "6128b3d154a0fc29cb29df40",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 6
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is intentional-- we found that people very often wanted to enforce a size 1 instance, but couldn't do so due to the hard-cap doubling of the soft-cap. So, softcap of 1 is a special case-- it forces hardcap to 1 as well.\nWe probably won't make any changes to this behavior for now, as this is still something we want to keep.\nIf you want to enforce 2 players, you could set the world to 2 soft-cap and disable the functionality of the world via Udon if there exists more than 2?\nIn reality we probably just need to re-approach how we do hard and soft cap.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
