      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Newly joined person will be disappointed if they are denied due to limited number of people after waiting for long loading, If I set  headcount limit by udon. I'd like to see a fundamental solution to this problem if possible. For example, when creating an instance, it should be possible to freely set the number of people allowed in the instance.",
