  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-27T09:43:45.217Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I tried to create a world that would only stay 2 players.\nBut I couldn't.\nBecause If player capacity is 1 then maximum number of players is 1, no one can join else instance owner. However player capacity is more then 2 then actually maximum number of players is player capacity*2(when player capacity is 2 then 4 players can stay in world).\nIt's not consistent. Please fix to can stay 2 players in player capacity is 1 world or player capacity to actually maximum players in instance",
